            "review_text": "Quyen L\n3 contributions\n0\nBrunch\nOct 2025 • Couples\nWe came during lunch and it was packed, everything is good. The Tomyum is alittle bit spicy, we don't like that. But aside from the soup, we also ordered Mango Sticky Rice, Thai lemon tea, and Crab Fried Rice. Oh the smoky flavor, the Wok Hei hit the spot.\nWritten October 3, 2025",
